\mathsf{Rule}_{Obj}^{Twelf}
=
\{(\langle\rangle,\Sigma_T;\Gamma\vdash x:A):x:A\in\Gamma\}
\cup
\{(\langle\rangle,\Sigma_T;\Gamma\vdash c:A):c:A\in\Sigma_T\}
\cup
\{(\langle\Sigma_T;\Gamma,x:A\vdash M:B\rangle,
\Sigma_T;\Gamma\vdash\lambda x:A.M:\Pi x:A.B)\}
\cup
\{(\langle\Sigma_T;\Gamma\vdash M:\Pi x:A.B,\
\Sigma_T;\Gamma\vdash N:A\rangle,
\Sigma_T;\Gamma\vdash M\,N:B[x:=N])\}
\cup
\{(\langle\Sigma_T;\Gamma\vdash M:A,\ \Sigma_T;\Gamma\vdash B:\mathsf{type}\rangle,
\Sigma_T;\Gamma\vdash M:B):A\equiv_{\beta\eta}^{Twelf}B\}.
